  "source": "# Semantics: capture postfix binds the GUARD (parsanol-ruby#380) —\n# `!digit as year` is `( !digit ) as year`, never `!(digit as year)`.\ngrammar GuardCapture version \"1.0.0\" {\n  digit = %x30-39\n  colon = \":\"\n  word = \"AMD\" / \"COR\"\n  year = ( colon ) ( word ) [ colon ( \"19\" / \"20\" ) 2*digit !digit as year ]\n  entry year: year\n  test {\n    accept \":AMD:1999\"\n    reject \"nonsense\"\n  }\n}\n",
